WEBVTT

00:02:56.252 --> 00:03:00.048
Allow me to give you a briefing

00:03:00.048 --> 00:03:02.240
about my story.

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.276
It was May, 2011,

00:03:04.276 --> 00:03:06.235
and I was complaining to a work colleague

00:03:06.235 --> 00:03:08.069
about the harassments I had to face

00:03:08.069 --> 00:03:09.857
trying to find a ride back home,

00:03:09.857 --> 00:03:13.341
although I have a car and an international driver's license.

00:03:13.341 --> 00:03:15.466
As long as I've known, women in Saudi Arabia

00:03:15.466 --> 00:03:17.952
have been always complaining about the ban,

00:03:17.952 --> 00:03:20.368
but it's been 20 years since anyone

00:03:20.368 --> 00:03:22.400
tried to do anything about it,

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:24.600
a whole generation ago.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:26.736
He broke the good/bad news in my face.

00:03:26.736 --> 00:03:29.893
"But there is no law banning you from driving."

00:03:29.893 --> 00:03:32.097
I looked it up, and he was right.